window.products.push({"id":957210,"name":"July Home Decor Foggy Forest Painting, Canvas Wall Art Mountain Picture Prints Hang on Wall for Interior Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+3snDYQRL._AC_SL1474_.jpg","description":"Introduction(Life Tree): * It is canvas prints,not hand-painted painting,there is not difference in the product itself.  * The artwork contrasts with the colors of the environment and environment, and you will get unexpected viewing effects.In different environments, the viewing effects of artworks are slightly different. * The artwork giving your living room, bedroom, guest room, bathroom, kitchen, dinning room, meeting room, hallway, nurseries, coffee house, condo house, hotels, inn, spa, lounge, sauna and other spaces of home, family, office, and so on add the elegant artistic atmosphere. Installation: 1.Each canvas print has been stretched on the solid wood frame. 2.Install accessory kit: * Two kinds of hanging nails：One is for nailing harder walls, and the other is for softer walls (wooden walls). *A soft ruler：Used to measure the distance between two holes for marking. *A level gauge：After nailing one nail into the wall, hang the painting, measure the level, and then make a mark and nail the other nail. *Hang up the painting, installation is complete. Suggestions for using products: Avoid hanging in where has direct sunlight or high temperature. \" About Us: These processes are designed and selected for many times before trial production, and then experience the quality of the product in a professional scene. After the feedback effect reaches the expected goal, the small batch mass production will be introduced to the market. If you have any questions, please feedback to us, thank you very much!\" We produce Various decorative paintings, Modern painting, Abstract painting, Figure painting,Tree painting, Flower painting, Cartoon painting , Animal painting, Landscape painting etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+3snDYQRL._AC_SL1474_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"July Home Decor","source_asin":"B07Y9FBT59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y9FBT59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y9FBT59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
