window.products.push({"id":957287,"name":"Greatest Ohio State Football Plays: Leatherette Coasters (Set of 4) | Best Gift Idea for Sports Lovers | Ohio State Historic Moments Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gEgGNkFaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"FOUR DISTINCT PLAYS FROM OHIO STATE HISTORY Relive four of the greatest moments in Ohio State football history. Each set comes with four laser-etched coasters depicting these historic plays: 2006 Big Ten Regular Season vs Michigan - Game of the Century 1974 Rose Bowl vs USC - 47 yards seals it 2003 National Championship vs Miami - First to 14 wins 1969 Rose Bowl vs USC - Battle of the Unbeatens These leatherette coasters are laser etched to reveal a vibrant silver foil. - Size: 4'' x 4'' x 0.15'' per coaster - Weight: 0.15lbs (4oz) - Stitched border THE PERFECT GIFT Our coaster sets are adored by sports lovers. Whether bought for yourself or for your teenage boy, teen girl, boyfriend, husband, wife, father or mother. Often bought by women for the man in their life or vis versa, our 12,000+ five-star reviews on Etsy and our website are full of satisfied customers. SOMETHING DIFFERENT Extremely unique, our Ohio State coaster set is a top choice amongst fans. Not the same-old logo slapped onto a product, our coasters showcase memories that real fans immediately recognize and begin smiling and telling stories about their favorite moments. 12,000+ FIVE STAR REVIEWS \"My boyfriend saw these coasters at our friends house and HE LOVED them. They were talking about remembering each play. It’s a really great gift for the sports lover in your life. THE QUALITY IS GREAT and they look so nice.\" - Lindsay, 9/20/2022 Notice: No sports player, team, league, or playoff is affiliated with Playbook Products or is the source of, is responsible for, or has endorsed, sponsored, or authorized these products or this website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gEgGNkFaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BL42Y8W4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL42Y8W4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL42Y8W4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
