window.products.push({"id":957636,"name":"Aerostem Balloon Sticks: Stylish 42-inch Tall Stems Hold 8 Balloons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KqZClZ1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Aerostem Starter Pack includes 4 balloon sticks, which hold 8 balloons. Stands and balloons are sold separately.Aerostem Balloon Sticks are a beautiful alternative to expensive and troublesome helium balloons. Aerostems give ordinary air-filled balloons the look and feel of fresh helium balloons without the cost and expense of helium gas. Aerostems keep balloons bouncy and robust for days outdoors and up to a month indoors -- that's performance you'd never get with helium balloons.With Aerostem, you no longer have to waste valuable time going out to buy troublesome helium balloons every time you host an event. What's more, by using your own balloons you are unlimited in your creativity and color choices, and Aerostem's stylish design will fit in with any decor. Aerostems are great for parties, weddings, celebrations, and even open house events!Aerostem's patent-pending design holds two air-filled balloons on each stick for double the impact, while at the same time saving you money by not requiring expensive helium! Aerostems are generously sized to stand 52 inches tall with two 12-inch balloons attached. Aerostems are made of lightweight steel, reusable and ideal for everyday use. Aerostems can be easily attached to anything you can think of - it's up to your imagination!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KqZClZ1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"natcha fon","source_asin":"B003EWA240","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003EWA240","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003EWA240","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
