window.products.push({"id":957714,"name":"Gorgeous Salt and Pepper Shaker With Adjustable Pour Holes - Perfect Dispenser for your Salts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vW0+Ey1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fill the Salt and Pepper Shaker with the spices of your choice, choose a portion size - thanks to the different pour holes in the lid - and a couple of shakes later you’ll have the perfect amount of seasoning on your meal! Thoughtful design combined with excellent quality: To maintain the freshness of your favorite spices, the shaker comes with a lid that has a closed setting (no hole), which also keeps both dust and moisture out. To make the salt shaker a long-lasting gem, only premium materials have been used. The lid and the shell are made of non-corrosive stainless steel, the hidden bottle is a sturdy glass jar. The shaker is identical and due to it's light weight and ideal shape (2.6x2.6x.4.5 inches) very comfortable to both hold and use. The himalayan salt dispenser and pepper shaker also charm with their looks! The dynamic shaker gives your table or counter a classy highlight: a timeless stainless steel shell encloses the interior glass bottle. A beautiful and functional addition to your home! Quick and easy refills & cleaning: Filling the salt and pepper condiment shaker is super easy since you have two options to refill them: either unscrew the top lid or twist off the stainless steel top from the glass bottle. Please give your spices some space and air and only top up your Himalayan salt shaker to about ¾ of capacity. To clean the kosher salt shaker simply unscrew the units and rinse each part separately. Before refilling the sea salt and pepper shaker, let the shaker completely dry out and then make sure to close it tight by twisting it clockwise. Spices are not included!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vW0+Ey1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIBAGA","source_asin":"B08HCZL1V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCZL1V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCZL1V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
