window.products.push({"id":957843,"name":"Trendy Tripper Swedish Dishcloth - Cat Designs Pink Cats Collage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+xR26o4WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE SWEDISH ECO-FRIENDLY DISHCLOTH: All Swedish Dishcloths sold by Trendy Tripper are made in Europe with natural fibers 70% cellulose wood pulp and 30% recycled cotton fibers. The sponge cloth fabric was invented in 1949 by a Swedish engineer and since then the Swedish dishcloth has been a household staple in most Scandinavian homes. Just lately they have been available in the US. Each Swedish dishcloth will replace 15-17 rolls of paper towel, saving cost and saving our planet. The sponge cloth acts much like a sponge in that it absorbs 15 times its weight in water and is very useful in wiping nearly all household surfaces. The wet sponge cloth is soft like a chamois and is great for wiping up spills or wiping down surfaces in the kitchen and bathroom. Perfect for cleaning refrigerators and refrigerator shelves, stovetops and countertops, even granite. It is also great for washing pans with non-stick surfaces. Many customers even use them for wiping baby’s hands, face and high chairs. Another unique feature is that the Swedish dishcloth dries very quickly which discourages bacteria from growing! This is key to having a clean kitchen. Allow it to dry after use and it should feel clean and not smell like the usual sponges do. The dishcloth is machine washable or you can wash it on the top shelf in the dishwasher. Or pop in the microwave (when damp) for 1 minute. The sponge cloth may be washed a couple hundred times. You can either dry them briefly in the clothes dryer or allow it to air dry. Hang on a dishcloth rail inside the sink where it can dry quickly. When you find that your cloth has reached its life expectancy, toss into your compost heap because it is biodegradable! The possibilities are endless. Customers use these to wipe the boat, do spring cleaning, at the cottage, in your car, for outdoor furniture, in the baby’s room. You will find many different ways for cleaning up with the Swedish dishcloth aka Swedish sponge cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+xR26o4WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trendy Tripper","source_asin":"B07GV4ZCKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GV4ZCKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GV4ZCKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":957844,"name":"Bodosac Airmail Blanket 60x50 inch to My Daughter Letter Printed Quilts Mom for Daughter's Air Mail Blanket Positive Encourage and Love Daughter's Fla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614bM07j0xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Pecification: Name: Flannel Blanket Material: polyester fiber (polyester) Size: 130*150cm  Features: 1. Constructed from an ultra-soft polyester fabric with soft cotton filling. 2. Each quilt features a premium polyester print for beautiful color vibrancy, even after washing. 3. The diamond stitched pattern gives a luxurious feel that is cozy and breathable, perfect for all year round use. 4. Machine washable with cold water gentle cycle and mild detergent. 5. It is very suitable for indoor and outdoor use to provide continuous warmth in all seasons, especially during camping and picnic-gifts for men and women, gifts for mom and dad, Valentine's Day, Mother and Father's Day, Christmas. Package list: 1 x Flannel Blanket","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614bM07j0xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodosac","source_asin":"B08P9J9DZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P9J9DZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P9J9DZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":957845,"name":"Duck River Textile April 4920=1+ Comforter Set, Queen, Navy Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lsbrn8zTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPANY HISTORY Founded over twenty years ago by the Cohen Brothers buying fabrics from the U.S. Mills, producing sheet sets, window, and shower curtains. They have a 75 year family history in Textiles, going back to their Grandfather, who had his own Spinning and Weaving Mill overseas.He taught his grandsons all about Fabrics and Techniques which they still use until today. Fifteen years ago, as the U.S. Mills started shutting down one by one, the Cohen Brothers were one of the first who had the foresight to move their factory overseas. They created partnerships and joint ventures Worldwide, which continuously keeps expanding till today. They continue with there Fashion Forward thinking giving them and their factories a leading edge in the market place. Duck River Inc has been praised and recognized by many in the industry for their Quality, Foresight, and On Time Deliveries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lsbrn8zTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duck River Textile","source_asin":"B07C9QCXJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C9QCXJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C9QCXJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":957846,"name":"VOLTERIN Ice Cube Tray - Flexible BPA Free Ice Cube Mold Trays with Lid Covers for Freezer - Silicone 111 Ice Molds 3 Pack with Easy Release Ice Cubes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hGS2X4dEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design and Functionality: Flexible design that ensures a quick release of ice cubes maker. Made with top quality silicone. Each ice cube tray features 35-cube and a smart shape covered lid, which helps you make mini sized cubes easily. Just fill the trays with water/fruits/cream/soda/whisky/wine, cover the lid and put them into the freezer. Since it is dishwasher safe, you could just put them into you dishwasher after use Safe, Healthy and Hygienic: Silicon ice trays don’t contain any harmful BPA (bisphenol A), a chemical often used in the production of many plastic products. Although they are soft and pliable, tests have shown that they don’t leach any chemicals into the ice itself, making them very safe and true healthy as an alternative to traditional plastic ice trays. This ice tray with lids makes super fashioned ideal for freezing cocktail, wine and even baby food. Less Wastage: Plastic ice cube trays are very solid, big, old fashioned and difficult to flex, so there tends to be significant wasted ice in bin as a result of ice cubes shattering, jumping out of the tray to land on the floor, or simply sticking solidly in the tray. With silicone ice cube tray, the ice cubes are easier to remove, making it far less likely that they will shatter, break or fall on the floor when you’re preparing drinks. Creative with Flavor: Silicon ice container are a healthy, safe way to prepare flavored ice cubes for cute chewy ice, as they don’t absorb anything from the contents stored in them. You can freeze different flavored ice cubes for fun without worrying that the flavor will be affected by the silicon itself. Some favorites for flavored ice cubes include lemon, lime and berries, whiskey ice, ice ball mold, bourbon – great for cocktails or for adding a touch of taste to iced water Easy to Use: Ice cube trays are very easy to use. Firstly, wash with warm water and soap, rinsing and drying it thoroughly. Then, pour in water just below the molding’s shape. Place in the freezer, once frozen, remove the silicon ice cube holder from the freezer. Then hold it upside down over an ice bucket and press gently on the bottom of each cube through the silicon, causing it to release cleanly. Clean well before reusing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hGS2X4dEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Volterin","source_asin":"B08GPZKY36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-957846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GPZKY36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GPZKY36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
