window.products.push({"id":958001,"name":"CoTa Global Pacific Starfish Beach 3.5x3.5 Frame - Star Fish Photo Frame for Summer Vacation Memory, Handmade Tropical Seashell Nautical Picture Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717c+O1GrvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE PACIFIC STARFISH BEACH FRAME COMES WITH A UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE - Shaped like a starfish, the beach theme picture frame puts up your cherished summer photo with your loved ones. Preserve your best memories with the ocean picture frame or input your beach vacation memories and set up the Starfish vacation photo frame as a refreshing beach office decor. THE STARFISH BEACH PICTURE HOLDER IS PERFECT FOR SEASIDE LOVERS - Your treasured memory on the beach can now be enclosed in this unique Starfish picture frame! Charming nautical accents like the Starfish beachy photo frame brightens any seaside themed room, wall, table and desk. Now you can fondly look back on your last cruise vacation or trip to the beach placed in a charming seashell frame. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF PACIFIC STARFISH 3.5x3.5 FRAME - Includes 1 Pacific Starfish beach theme photo frame shaped like a cute starfish. Hand crafted nautical decor with rough sandy texture. Beach vacation frame is made to resemble a starfish with its 5 legs. It can hold 3.5x3.5 photos for summer memories. The nautical frame measures 8Lx0.25Wx7.25H inches. HIGH QUALITY STARFISH BEACH FRAME - Made of high quality materials, the Pacific Starfish beach picture frame is a durable nautical decor for your themed room. Hand crafted with care, beautiful rough sand and luminescent frame adds to the beauty of this accent on your tabletop or shelf. The Pacific Starfish 3.5x3.5 beach picture frame is an eye-catching decor for your home and a great gift for a friend who loves beach trips and nautical decor. IDEAL USE FOR THE PACIFIC STARFISH BEACH PHOTO FRAME - Highlight your cherished memory of a beach vacation with the Pacific Starfish nautical picture frame! A beautiful vacation decor that perfectly encases your memorable grand cruise or romantic trip to the beach with loved ones. The opalescent rustic frame is embellished with genuine rocky sand taking you back to that unforgettable outing to the sea side.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717c+O1GrvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B011VQ1H3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011VQ1H3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011VQ1H3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
